  "notes": [
    "TP-Link VIGI product pages have moved to www.vigi.com. The NZ regional listing (https://www.vigi.com/nz/business-networking/vigi-network-camera/) returns no products, so the TP-Link Australia VIGI site (www.vigi.com/au/) was used for all items; datasheets are the TP-Link PDFs linked from the AU download pages (C445 datasheet from the global /en/ download page).",
    "Camera products are one entry per model with lensOptions/hfovByLensDeg; orderable lens codes are in orderableVariants (e.g. 'VIGI C340(4mm)').",
    "Only fields that agree between the AU product page and the datasheet are recorded; conflicts are listed per product in notes/unverified.",
    "VIGI C440 and VIGI C450 turrets were NOT included as outdoor cameras: neither the AU page nor the datasheet prints an IP rating (Protection: N/A). The IP67 outdoor turrets are VIGI C445 (4MP) and VIGI C455 (5MP). C440 V2 also shows conflicting HFOV and max power between page and datasheet.",
    "poeStandard on cameras: printed as '802.3af/at, class 0'.",
    "activeDeterrence = alarm linkage 'Audible Warning' (built-in speaker) and 'White Light Flashing' (built-in white LEDs); no separate siren or red/blue strobe.",
    "No vandal (IK) rating is printed for any of these cameras.",
    "VJB-305 junction box exists but TP-Link's compatibility list does not include any of the cameras in this file (InSight series only), so it was left out.",
    "Kits ship with a 2TB HDD preinstalled; TP-Link does not state the HDD make/model, so no HDD product was added.",
    "Both NVR1104H-4P and NVR1004H-4P are current 4-ch PoE+ models on the AU site; NVR1104H-4P is the newer one (side-access HDD bay, built-in speaker). Both NVR1008H-8MP (113 W PoE) and NVR1008H-8P (53 W PoE) are current (hardware V1.20).",
    "VIGI InSight S455 added 2026-10-03 for the IT Plus 4-camera VIGI system: IT Plus stocks the InSight S range, not the C340/C350/C445/C455 (no IT Plus listing). Specs from the AU product page and the V1 datasheet; junction boxes from the AU accessories list."
  ]
